WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.900
This is Omerta running locally, with synthetic accounts and real API handlers. We will salvage a wreck, craft a material, and complete a shared investigation.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:21.600
The World Graph records the change. This salvage recipe consumes one wreck and produces six scrap steel, two wire, and two salvage parts.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:31.700
Crafting hardened steel consumes four scrap steel and three hundred in game cash. The resulting inventory holds one hardened steel and two remaining scrap steel.
